WEBVTT

00:12:57.542 --> 00:13:00.643
Be a bit more Irish, if you like.

00:13:00.667 --> 00:13:02.434
(Laughter)

00:13:02.458 --> 00:13:05.559
Maybe you just never recognized yourself

00:13:05.583 --> 00:13:08.250
as part of the same mortal community.

00:13:09.417 --> 00:13:13.601
But it is easy to reconnect
if you want to try.

00:13:13.625 --> 00:13:16.851
Not because you're being altruistic,

00:13:16.875 --> 00:13:19.976
but for purely selfish reasons.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.542
Free dying lessons.

00:13:23.667 --> 00:13:27.309
Who else did you expect
would teach you how to die

00:13:27.333 --> 00:13:30.667
apart from another dying human?